{"unit_id":"YUEYUEXYS__dsh-think-ultra#feature-1","repo":"YUEYUEXYS/dsh-think-ultra","commit":"f406136bddbbf13635975e57f3cd99d49e244cec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Think Ultra 的功能「effort」：推理档位「Ultra」：在 DSH 模型档位中补入 Ultra 选项，并在发送请求时映射回模型支持的 max 档。用户从原生推理档位选择器触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host/ultra-adapter.js:29-51","lib/index.js:764-785"]}
{"unit_id":"YUEYUEXYS__dsh-think-ultra#feature-2","repo":"YUEYUEXYS/dsh-think-ultra","commit":"f406136bddbbf13635975e57f3cd99d49e244cec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Think Ultra 的功能「primer」：请求前深度预演：agent 回合开始前按当前模式和能力配置执行思考预演，并把生成的摘要注入后续提示消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host/agent-hooks.js:1430-1464"]}
{"unit_id":"YUEYUEXYS__dsh-think-ultra#feature-3","repo":"YUEYUEXYS/dsh-think-ultra","commit":"f406136bddbbf13635975e57f3cd99d49e244cec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Think Ultra 的功能「toolbox」：模型可调用推理工具：提供 super_think 工具，让模型针对执行中的新难题提交任务和深度级别，并返回思考摘要与执行信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host/ultra-tools.js:1158-1195"]}
{"unit_id":"YUEYUEXYS__dsh-think-ultra#feature-4","repo":"YUEYUEXYS/dsh-think-ultra","commit":"f406136bddbbf13635975e57f3cd99d49e244cec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Think Ultra 的功能「controls」：推理设置面板：注册语言、Ultra 开关、滑杆、模块、全局开关和偏好指令等设置，并监听设置变化。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:791-811"]}
